OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FWords by ITV News Producer Andy Ward
OL,9,FAt least 41 migrants have now died
OL,10,Ftrying to reach Spain's North African
OL,11,Fenclave of Ceuta in what is being
OL,12,Fdescribed as a "serious humanitarian
OL,13,Fcrisis".
OL,15,FVideos and images showed tens of
OL,16,Fthousands of people trying to reach
OL,17,Fthe territory, many of them swimming
OL,18,Fto get there, with Spain deploying its
OL,19,Fmilitary in a bid to restore order at
OL,20,Fthe border with Morocco.
OL,26,@tD@POU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
