OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FThe situation boiled over into Friday
OL,8,Fas Ceuta's president, Juan Jesus
OL,9,FVivas, told a press conference that at
OL,10,Fleast 60,000 people had crossed into
OL,11,Fthe territory over the past 24 hours
OL,12,Falone.
OL,14,FSpain's interior ministry estimated
OL,15,Fthe figure was slightly lower, about
OL,16,F50,000, and said that half had already
OL,17,Freturned to Morocco.
OL,19,FBut what has prompted the mass
OL,20,Fcrossings in the first place? ITV News
OL,21,Fexplains.
OL,26,@pD@_rz
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
