OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FWhat is happening?
OL,9,FMoroccan migrants have been pouring
OL,10,Finto Ceuta, an autonomous city in
OL,11,FSpain, in their droves this week,
OL,12,Fcompletely overwhelming local
OL,13,Fauthorities.
OL,15,FThings came to a head on Thursday when
OL,16,Ftens of thousands entered the tiny
OL,17,FSpanish territory - the majority of
OL,18,Fthem by sea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FAt least 41 people died, many of them
OL,8,Fdrowning, but according to Rachid
OL,9,FSbihi, head of the association that
OL,10,Frepresents Spain's Civil Guard
OL,11,Fofficers, some were also killed in a
OL,12,Fstampede near the breakwater fence at
OL,13,FTarajal beach.
OL,15,FA video shows the moment migrants
OL,16,Fbreach the border
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FSbihi called the situation a "serious
OL,8,Fhumanitarian crisis," and said that
OL,9,Fthe migrants, including unaccompanied
OL,10,Fchildren, "were left sleeping in parks
OL,11,Fand on sidewalks, while others roamed
OL,12,Fthe streets aimlessly".
OL,14,FIn an attempt to get a grip on things,
OL,15,FSpain rushed members of its military
OL,16,Fand extra police officers to Ceuta
OL,17,Fwhile Moroccan police reportedly used
OL,18,Fwater cannons and fired warning shots
OL,19,Finto the air to try to stop people
OL,20,Fentering the sea.
OL,26,@oD@^OUpD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
