OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FWhere is Ceuta?
OL,9,FCeuta is a small city on North
OL,10,FAfrica's coast, which shares its only
OL,11,Fborder with Morocco.
OL,13,FIt is separated from mainland Spain by
OL,14,Fthe Strait of Gibraltar, and has
OL,15,Fbelonged to the country since the 16th
OL,16,Fcentury.
OL,18,FMorocco has long claimed sovereignty
OL,19,Fover the city because of its
OL,20,Fgeographical location, but that has
OL,21,Falways been denied by the Spanish.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FCeuta and Melilla are the only
OL,8,FEuropean territories on mainland
OL,9,FAfrica - making them attractive to
OL,10,FAfrican migrants in particular, who
OL,11,Fsee the cities as a gateway to Europe.
OL,13,FIt is heavily policed and is protected
OL,14,Fby a barbed wire fence, but crucially,
OL,15,Fit also has a port and a beach.
OL,17,FThat means many migrants often see the
OL,18,Fdangerous three-mile swim from the
OL,19,FMoroccan town of Fnideq as their best
OL,20,Fchance of breaching the border.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FOthers attempt the crossing from the
OL,8,Fnearby town of Belyounech, where the
OL,9,Fdistance is shorter.
OL,11,FAccording to migration data from the
OL,12,FUN, 2,826 people had crossed into
OL,13,FCeuta up until July 15 this year. That
OL,14,Ffigure is set to rise significantly.
OL,15,FWhy are so many migrants coming over?
OL,17,FThe reason behind the surge is not yet
OL,18,Fclear, but the Spanish government
OL,19,Facknowledged it may be down to a
OL,20,Fruling in the country's Supreme Court
OL,21,Fearlier this month.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FThe court ruled that any migrants
OL,8,Fstopped at sea while trying to reach
OL,9,FCeuta can no longer be immediately
OL,10,Fpushed back across the border, unlike
OL,11,Fthose who arrive by land.
OL,13,F"This crisis stems from an
OL,14,Finterpretation of a Supreme Court's
OL,15,Fdecision, according to which people
OL,16,Fwho swim illegally across the border
OL,17,Fcannot be returned," the Spanish
OL,18,Fgovernment said in a statement late on
OL,19,FThursday.
OL,26,@uD@AOUyD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,F"It appears that this interpretation
OL,8,Fof the Supreme Court's ruling spread
OL,9,Flike wildfire over the past few hours
OL,10,Fthrough the networks of human
OL,11,Ftrafficking organisations, triggering
OL,12,Fthe kind of mass surge we witnessed
OL,13,Fyesterday," Spanish Prime Minister
OL,14,FPedro Sanchez added on Friday.
OL,16,FHowever, humanitarian activists in
OL,17,FMorocco expressed doubt that the
OL,18,Fruling was the catalyst for the
OL,19,Fcrossings, arguing most migrants would
OL,20,Fhave been unaware of such legal
OL,21,Fdecisions.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@KO]vD@Hrp
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
