OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FAs for why so many Moroccans are
OL,8,Ffleeing?
OL,10,FMorocco has long struggled with high
OL,11,Funemployment rates among young people,
OL,12,Fwhich means many are willing to risk
OL,13,Ftheir lives for a better future abroad
OL,14,Finstead.
OL,16,FOne of those is Ahmed Karim, a 33-year
OL,17,Fold Moroccan, who said he had made the
OL,18,Fjourney Ceuta because of the lack of
OL,19,Fjobs in his own country.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30712
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,F"Many people want to go to Europe,
OL,8,FAmerica, but they don't have the
OL,9,Fopportunity," he told The Associated
OL,10,FPress.
OL,12,FWhat has the political reaction been?
OL,14,FSpeaking during a visit to Ceuta on
OL,15,FFriday, Spanish Prime Minister Pedro
OL,16,FSanchez described the escalating
OL,17,Fsituation as "a violation of Spain's
OL,18,Fterritorial integrity".
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@MO]xD@BrpyD@NOUzD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
