PN,30713
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FHe said the Spanish government was
OL,8,Fworking hard to return all illegal
OL,9,Fmigrants to Morocco "as soon as
OL,10,Fpossible", and blamed the surge on
OL,11,Fpeople smugglers, saying: "They
OL,12,Fdeceive so many young people, and
OL,13,Fultimately lead many of them to their
OL,14,Fdeaths".
OL,16,FCeuta's president called the crisis
OL,17,F"absolutely unsustainable" as many
OL,18,FEuropean leaders vowed to tighten
OL,19,Fborder controls.
OL,26,@sD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
