CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FItaly's Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni
OL,8,Fthreatened to suspend Italy's Schengen
OL,9,Fzone agreement with Spain on free
OL,10,Fmovement, promising "extraordinary
OL,11,Fmeasures to defend our borders and
OL,12,Fensure the safety of our citizens".
OL,14,FWhat those measures would be though
OL,15,Fisn't obvious.
OL,17,FItaly and Spain don't share a land
OL,18,Fborder, so the most likely outcome
OL,19,Fwould be extra checks for airline
OL,20,Fpassengers or those arriving by sea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30715
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FThe Schengen Agreement allows more
OL,8,Fthan 450 million people to travel
OL,9,Ffreely across 29 European nations, but
OL,10,Fcountries can temporarily bring back
OL,11,Fpassport checks if they believe there
OL,12,Fis a serious threat to security.
OL,14,FFrench Interior Minister Laurent Nunez
OL,15,Fsaid France would also strengthen
OL,16,Fborder checks with Spain.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30716
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785523717
OL,3,CCueta crisis: Why are so many migrants
OL,4,Cdesperate to cross into the Spanish
OL,5,Ccity?
OL,7,FFinland's Interior Minister Mari
OL,8,FRantanen also backed Meloni's stance,
OL,9,Fsaying that Spain had "completely
OL,10,Ffailed" to secure its border", while
OL,11,FEU chief Ursula von der Leyen wrote on
OL,12,FX that the scenes in Ceuta were
OL,13,F"unacceptable" and "dangerous
OL,14,Fcrossings must stop immediately".
OL,16,FUK Prime Minister Andy Burnham said on
OL,17,FFriday the government had offered to
OL,18,Fhelp Spain, but added "it was a matter
OL,19,Ffor the Spanish government first and
OL,20,Fforemost."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
